          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ongoye ŋat'oyido omiyere kicutho timo reco ruwaŋ Rwoth paka Ahab rupiri cege Yezebel oyido dwoŋo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.25",
